                  "description": "Track the activity of your users while your program is active. If set above, this will be equal to your program duration."
                },
                {
                  "key": 1,
                  "icon": "hourglass",
                  "title": "For a limited amount of time within the program duration",
                  "description": "Track the activity of your users for a limited amount of time specific to each user. (e.g. User actions are only valid within the first 30 days after they signup)"
                }
